(
    title: "Holey Moley",
    developer: Some("Bob Polaro"),
    description: Some("Whack-a-mole with one button per hole: each key on the pad maps to a burrow, and pressing it swings the hammer there. Moles score ten to forty points, crowned king moles up to a hundred, and acorns thirty to fifty. Every third round fills the screen with moles and randomises which button goes where, so you are guessing as much as aiming."),
